            </note>
            <note corresp="#d165-f2" n="2" xml:id="d165-f2-content">
                <p>Komer commented on this p ARA graph and wrote the
                    following note at the bottom of the page: “Iʼm asking Bowdler to look at pros and cons of surfacing
                    this.”</p>
            </note>
